r brother, Grakaw? Although we've been hidden in these depths, we could hear his roar clearly. His anger and pain shook the land itself. When he rampaged into these caverns, we wanted to help him. Unfortunately, being hidden in these caves for so long has given us our own set of [complications].'\nYou say, 'What complications?'\nValia, the Great Bear Spirit says, 'Our spiritual power helps plants and animals flourish. Being confined in such a small cavern means our energy is flooding these tunnels. Plants are growing to extraordinary heights. Small bugs have become bigger and more aggressive. As these creatures evolve, they sap more and more of our [spirit]. We simply do not have the power we once did, before these caves began to drain it from us.'\nYou say, 'Can I get your spirit back?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Bravery of a Bear'.\nValia, the Great Bear Spirit says, 'Occasionally, you'll find accumulations of our power floating around the cave. It begins to crystallize and can no longer be absorbed by the creatures here. You should be able to break these orbs open and gather our power from within. Please proceed with caution; the raw power will hurt you if you aren't careful. I sense that you have a tremendous amount of courage, but remember that there is a fine line between bravery and foolishness.'\n\n---\n\nValia, the Great Bear Spirit has lived in the underbelly of Luclin for many years. Her and her siblings' spiritual energy makes plants and animal thrive, but what was once a blessing to the Kerran has turned into a nightmare for the Primal Spirits. As the flora and fauna flourish around them, more and more of their power is sapped by the growing creatures. Occasionally, large amounts of their spirit will accumulate and crystallize before it can be absorbed by the beasts in Darklight Caverns. Shattering these spirit orbs will release the energy from within. With this energy, the Primal Spirits can begin healing themselves.\n1\\. Collect 3 Freed Spirits of Bravery 0/3 Darklight Caverns\n> **Quest Text:** Collect at least 3 Freed Spirits of Bravery\nKill any creatures in the east section to spawn a spirit of bravery.\n--You have looted a Freed Spirit of Bravery from a spirit of bravery's corpse.--\nYour task 'The Bravery of a Bear' has been updated.\n2\\. Give Valia, the Great Bear Spirit 3 Freed Spirits of Bravery 0/3 Darklight Caverns\n> **Quest Text:** Return 3 Freed Spirits of Bravery to Valia, the Great Bear Spirit.\nYou offered 3 Freed Spirit of Bravery to Valia, the Great Bear Spirit.\nYour task 'The Bravery of a Bear' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Bravery of a Bear' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Bravery of a Bear' has been updated.\nValia closes her eyes and sighs with relief as the spiritual essences merge with her celestial body. 'I am in your debt. I am still not at my full strength, but perhaps if you bring more spirits I will eventually be strong enough to help my siblings.'\nYour faction standing with The Primal Spirits has been adjusted by 25.\nYou complete the trade with Valia, the Great Bear Spirit.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nAt Level 120, 118 pp 5s 6cp\nExperience\n+25 faction with The Primal Spirits.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
