Spirit says, 'My siblings and I have been hiding in these dismal tunnels for many years now; it has dulled our senses. We're isolated from the rest of the world. We haven't heard from our creator, Sahteb Mahlni. We can barely hear the prayers of the Vah Shir who venerate us. We are completely cut off from the things that empowered us in the [past].'\nYou say, 'What if I help you regain your past strength?'\nYasil, the Great Tiger Spirit says, 'I'm sure you've noticed the floating orbs of energy in these caves. Can you find and [destroy] them? Those orbs contain wisps of my power, and if you return them to me I can recover some of my strength. Help me out enough and I may just have something special to reward you with.'\nYou say, 'I will destroy them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Cunning of a Tiger'.\nYasil, the Great Tiger Spirit smiles with her sharp teeth. 'You're so easily convinced! Be careful who you trust, Namasu. Don't let others manipulate you. Not everyone will be as kind as you are.' Unnervingly, she licks her lips as she watches you. Then, she cheerily continues, 'Luckily, I am completely trustworthy and am grateful for your help.'\n\n---\n\nYasil, the Great Tiger Spirit has lived in the underbelly of Luclin for many years. Her and her siblings' spiritual energy makes plants and animal thrive, but what was once a blessing to the Kerran has turned into a nightmare for the Primal Spirits. As the flora and fauna flourish around them, more and more of their power is sapped by the growing creatures. Occasionally, large amounts of their spirit will accumulate and crystallize before it can be absorbed by the beasts in Darklight Caverns. Shattering these spirit orbs will release the energy from within. With this energy, the Primal Spirits can begin healing themselves.\n1\\. Collect 3 Freed Spirits of Cunning 0/3 Darklight Caverns\n> **Quest Text:** Collect at least 3 Freed Spirits of Cunning\nKill any creatures in the southwest section to randomly spawn a spirit of cunning.\n--You have looted a Freed Spirit of Cunning from a spirit of cunning's corpse.--\nYour task 'The Cunning of a Tiger' has been updated.\n2\\. Give Yasil, the Great Tiger Sprit 3 Freed Spirits of Cunning 0/3 Darklight Caverns\n> **Quest Text:** Return 3 Freed Spirits of Cunning to Yasil, the Great Tiger Spirit.\nYou offered 3 Freed Spirit of Cunning to Yasil, the Great Tiger Spirit.\nYour task 'The Cunning of a Tiger' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Cunning of a Tiger' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Cunning of a Tiger' has been updated.\nYasil purrs as the spirits rejoin with her celestial form. 'You've impressed me. I was right to think that you are more cunning than the other creatures in this cave. Though, I suppose it's easy to outsmart a flower.'\nYour faction standing with The Primal Spirits has been adjusted by 25.\nYou complete the trade with Yasil, the Great Tiger Spirit.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nAt Level 120, 118pp 5s 6cp\nExperience\n+25 to The Primal Spirits Faction\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
